Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.55,0:00:07.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,Sponsorship sellers pitch the same few brands for every tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.09,0:00:12.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,Overlap tells you which brands to pitch, in which cities, and why,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.43,0:00:13.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,straight from Qloo's taste graph.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.13,0:00:18.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,Here's Phoebe Bridgers, five cities across the US.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.85,0:00:21.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,A Claude agent works through Qloo, city by city:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.51,0:00:25.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,which brands her fans love, how each city ranks them, and where the fans gather.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.63,0:00:30.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,Every brand and venue it reports is checked against the Qloo call it came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.19,0:00:33.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,The short answer comes first.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.95,0:00:37.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,Lead with Dr. Martens, the fans' top match.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.23,0:00:41.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then Polaroid, Boxed Water and Airbnb, top three in most of the tour's cities.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.85,0:00:43.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,And nothing is a black box:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.01,0:00:49.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,show the data, and you see the exact Qloo request and result behind every number.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.73,0:00:55.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,So why not just ask a chatbot? We did. Same model, no Qloo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.07,0:00:57.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then Overlap scores its picks in Qloo anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.59,0:01:02.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,They average a fan fit of 80. Overlap's list averages 87.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.21,0:01:05.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,Modelo and Amtrak barely register with these fans,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.27,0:01:08.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,and it misses Polaroid and Boxed Water entirely.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.99,0:01:11.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,Every city gets its own read:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.37,0:01:16.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,the music, books and places these fans love, where they gather,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.19,0:01:20.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,and venues nearby, each paired with a brand and an event idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.89,0:01:24.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,Pick a brand, and Overlap writes the pitch:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.99,0:01:29.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,why this brand, city by city, a measurement plan, and a ready-to-send email.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.23,0:01:31.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,You edit it and approve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.03,0:01:35.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,Only then can it leave the app, as an email or a branded PDF.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.47,0:01:40.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,Try your own tour: any artist, any cities, in about a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.45,0:01:44.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,That's Overlap: sponsors your fans already love.
